  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Fallen Fey sphere (Snare Setter (fey-blessing)), Trap sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> In place of the snare from your Snare Setter fey-blessing, you may place any snare from the Trap sphere that you possess. You do not require a trap bag to set such snares. You may use your ranks in Craft (traps) in place of your caster level when determining the effects of the Snare Setter talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fallen-fey#toc69\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
